  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE PROJECT OBJECTIVE IS TO SUPPORT THE GOVERNMENT POLICY TO PROVIDE LOCAL POPULATIONS IN THE EXTREME NORTH OF THE COUNTRY WITH BASIC SERVICES SUCH AS WATER SUPPLY. THIS WILL IMPROVE HEALTH CONDITIONS THROUGH BETTER WATER SUPPLY INCREA SE THE POPULATION&quot;S ACCESS TO SAFE AND CLEAN DRINKING WATER AND TO SALVAGE AN IMPORTANT INFRASTRUCTURE.</narrative>
  </description>
